# ==============================================================================
# Notepad++ 8.3.3 工作副本 —— .gitignore
#
# 覆盖三条产物链：
#   A. Visual Studio 2019 / MSBuild（v142 工具集）  → PowerEditor\visual.net\*.vcxproj
#   B. MinGW-w64 GCC（make）                        → PowerEditor\gcc\makefile
#   C. NSIS 安装包 / 7-Zip 便携包                    → PowerEditor\installer\*.nsi
#
# 设计原则：只忽略「构建产物 / 中间文件 / 机器本地文件」，
#           源码、以及源码树里随包分发的运行时文件（readme、change.log、
#           NppShell*.dll、userDefineLangs\ 等）一律进库。
#
# 基于上游 .gitignore 整理，修正两处会误伤源码的规则：
#   - 原 `*.sln`          → 会把 notepadPlus.sln 一起忽略，工程打不开
#   - 原 `*.log`          → 会把 PowerEditor/bin/change.log（更新日志）吞掉
# 详见文末「## 明确保留」段。
# ==============================================================================


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A. Visual Studio / MSBuild —— 目录类产物（任意层级）
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
ARM64/
[Oo]bj/
ipch/
.vs/


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A. Visual Studio / MSBuild —— 中间文件
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 用户 / IDE 本地状态
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.aps
*.ncb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.cachefile
*.opendb

# 编译 / 链接中间件
# 注意：这里刻意不写 *.pch —— VS 的预编译头都落在 obj\ / Debug\ / Release\ / x64\ 里，
# 已被上面的目录规则覆盖；而 scintilla\cocoa\*_Prefix.pch 是 Xcode 的源码文件，不能忽略。
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.idb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib.bak
*.rsp
*.sbr
*.pgc
*.pgd
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.res.tmp
*.tlh
*.tli
*.tlb
*.tmp
*.tmp_proj
*.pidb
*_i.c
*_p.c
*.meta

# 工程文件转换 / 备份
_UpgradeReport_Files/
Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.XML
UpgradeLog*.htm
*.bak

# VS 的筛选器文件：
#   notepadPlus.vcxproj.filters 由本仓库手工生成（让解决方案资源管理器显示目录树），需要入库；
#   其它工程若由 IDE 自动生成则不跟踪
*.vcxproj.filters
!PowerEditor/visual.net/notepadPlus.vcxproj.filters


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A. Visual Studio —— 本仓库的具体输出位置
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 64 位 / ARM64 输出目录：整个目录都是构建产物
PowerEditor/bin64/
PowerEditor/binarm64/

# 32 位输出目录 PowerEditor/bin/ 里「既有源码文件也有产物」，
# 因此逐个忽略产物，保留 readme.txt / change.log / doLocalConf.xml /
# nppLogNulContentCorruptionIssue.xml / NppShell*.dll / userDefineLangs/
PowerEditor/bin/notepad++.exe
PowerEditor/bin/SciLexer.dll
PowerEditor/bin/config.xml
PowerEditor/bin/config.model.xml
PowerEditor/bin/stylers.xml
PowerEditor/bin/stylers.model.xml
PowerEditor/bin/langs.xml
PowerEditor/bin/langs.model.xml
PowerEditor/bin/contextMenu.xml
PowerEditor/bin/shortcuts.xml
PowerEditor/bin/nativeLang.xml
PowerEditor/bin/session.xml
PowerEditor/bin/functionList.xml
PowerEditor/bin/backup/
PowerEditor/bin/localization/
PowerEditor/bin/themes/
PowerEditor/bin/plugins/
PowerEditor/bin/updater/
PowerEditor/bin/functionList/

# 旧版 shell 扩展产物名（当前版本用 NppShell.dll / NppShell64.dll，属于源码分发内容）
PowerEditor/bin/NppShell_06.dll
PowerEditor/bin/NppShell64_06.dll

# 字体等可选资源（如需随包分发请删除下面 4 行并提交）
PowerEditor/bin/SourceCodePro-Regular.ttf
PowerEditor/bin/SourceCodePro-Bold.ttf
PowerEditor/bin/SourceCodePro-It.ttf
PowerEditor/bin/SourceCodePro-BoldIt.ttf

# 工程内其它输出
PowerEditor/visual.net/Unicode Debug/
PowerEditor/visual.net/Unicode Release/
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShell/build_Win32/
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShell/build_x64/
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShell/build_ARM64/


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A. Scintilla / Lexilla 工程产物
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
scintilla/bin/SciLexer.*
scintilla/bin/Scintilla.*
scintilla/bin/libscintilla.lib
scintilla/bin/__init__.py
scintilla/win32/*.lib
scintilla/win32/*.o
scintilla/win32/ScintRes.res
scintilla/win32/Unicode Debug/
scintilla/win32/Unicode Release/
scintilla/boostregex/bin/
scintilla/boostregex/boostpath.mak
scintilla/lexilla/bin/
scintilla/lexilla/obj/
scintilla/lexilla/test/build/


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# B. MinGW-w64 GCC（PowerEditor/gcc/makefile）
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TARGET_DIRECTORY  = bin.$(TARGET_CPU)$(BUILD_SUFFIX)  → bin.i686 / bin.x86_64 / bin.x86_64-debug
# BUILD_DIRECTORY   = $(TARGET_DIRECTORY).build         → bin.x86_64.build（*.o / *.res 都在这）
# 注意：`bin.*` 不会误伤 PowerEditor/bin/（无点号）
bin.*
*.o
*.d
*.a

# GCC 版 32 位 exe 若被复制到 PowerEditor/bin/ 下
PowerEditor/bin/notepad++.exe


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# C. 安装包 / 便携包（NSIS + 7-Zip，由 installer\packageAll.bat 产出）
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PowerEditor/installer/build/
PowerEditor/installer/minimalist/
PowerEditor/installer/minimalist64/
PowerEditor/installer/minimalistArm64/
PowerEditor/installer/zipped.package.release/
PowerEditor/installer/zipped.package.release64/
PowerEditor/installer/zipped.package.releaseArm64/
PowerEditor/installer/bin/wingup/


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# D. 本工作副本专用的临时目录
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 便携 NSIS / 安装包冒烟测试用的临时工作区（当前已清空，保留规则防止以后误入库）
.tools/
# Notepad++ 运行时产生的日志（也覆盖 *.nppLogNulContentCorruptionIssue.log）
PowerEditor/bin/nppLogNulContentCorruptionIssue.log


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# E. 运行期 / 系统杂项
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.db
*.opendb
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
folder-*.ico
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*~
*.lock
*.DS_Store
*.swp
*.out
*.zip
scintilla/.hgeol
scintilla/.hgtags
scintilla/.hgignore
scintilla/.hg_archival.txt
scintilla/cppcheck.suppress
PowerEditor/src/MISC/md5/RCa06792


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ## 明确保留（不要忽略）—— 否定规则必须写在对应忽略规则之后
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 更新日志：被上面 *.log 命中，这里显式救回；打包脚本 copyCommonFiles 依赖它
!PowerEditor/bin/change.log
!PowerEditor/bin/nppLogNulContentCorruptionIssue.xml
# 解决方案文件：上游曾用 *.sln 忽略（依赖旧索引把 sln 强加进库），
# 新仓库必须显式保留，否则 git init 后整个解决方案都进不了库
!PowerEditor/visual.net/notepadPlus.sln

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 备注（给后来人）：
#  1. PowerEditor/bin/ 里的 langs.model.xml / stylers.model.xml / contextMenu.xml /
#     shortcuts.xml 属于「构建时从 PowerEditor/src/ 拷贝」的产物，故被忽略。
#     打包（nppSetup.nsi 的 copyCommonFiles 只读 ..\bin\）前若它们不存在，先执行：
#         Copy-Item PowerEditor\src\langs.model.xml,PowerEditor\src\stylers.model.xml,
#                   PowerEditor\src\contextMenu.xml,PowerEditor\src\shortcuts.xml PowerEditor\bin\
#  2. 安装包（PowerEditor\installer\build\npp.*.Installer*.exe）不进库，
#     如需分发请走 GitHub Releases 附件。
#  3. 本目录不是 git 仓库原始状态，构建相关的改造记录见 BUILD-VS2019-zh-CN.md。
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ## MSIX 打包产物（PowerEditor\visual.net\Packaging，见该目录 README.md）
#    图标 Assets\*.png 要进库，其余构建/签名产物不进库
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PowerEditor/visual.net/Packaging/bin/
PowerEditor/visual.net/Packaging/obj/
PowerEditor/visual.net/Packaging/AppPackages/
PowerEditor/visual.net/Packaging/*.pfx
PowerEditor/visual.net/Packaging/*.cer

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ## NppShellMsix（MSIX 右键菜单处理器）构建产物
#    源码在 PowerEditor\src\tools\NppShellMsix\，产物落 bin\ / bin64\ / binarm64\
#    bin64\ 和 binarm64\ 已整目录忽略，这里只补 bin\ 与工程中间目录
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PowerEditor/bin/NppShellMsix.dll
PowerEditor/bin/NppShellMsix.lib
PowerEditor/bin/NppShellMsix.exp
PowerEditor/bin/NppShellMsix.pdb
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShellMsix/Win32/
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShellMsix/x64/
PowerEditor/src/tools/NppShellMsix/ARM64/
